{"version":1,"content":"<p>為了迎接台灣新竹市立棒球場50周年的重要里程碑，開幕演出特別邀請「電音女神」謝金燕，以及韓國女團少女時代成員孝淵擔任嘉賓。</p><p>謝金燕乘坐特製粉紅飛機霸氣登場，還首度公開演唱時隔近9年的新歌《我來啦》，再展女神風範。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T18:20:44.361765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T18:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T18:18:13.172157+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T18:18:13.172157+00:00","content_hash":"29283c150b8d4a0d6b784cc9573a6db068915f1a5a876372134d2938d01dd7e8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}